flowchart TB
accTitle: Account storage and server disk are separate
accDescr: Protocol storage rent increases an FID’s message allowance, shared by its clients. Host disk holds the node’s copy of network state. These are separate purchases; increasing server disk does not increase account allowance.
subgraph A["Account storage · your FID"]
 rent["Pay protocol storage rent"]:::device
 limits["Message limits for your account"]:::service
 apps["Shared across your clients"]:::done
 rent --> limits --> apps
end
subgraph D["Server disk · your node host"]
 aws["Provide SSD capacity"]:::network
 disk[("Store the node database")]:::data
 aws --> disk
end
apps ~~~ aws
